<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5333/5373 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Friday will be 5353.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the bid/offer rates were 5331/5371, with the official dollar rate 5351 from Thursday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5180/5780 after 5178/5778.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
